#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:8
msgid "发送 API"
msgstr "Send API"

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:10
msgid "使用 `xgl_send_at(handle, &tx, now_ms)`，时间源与 `xgl_step()` 的单调毫秒时间一致。返回成功表示本地接纳，不代表远端应用已完成处理。"
msgstr ""
"Use `xgl_send_at(handle, &tx, now_ms)` with the same monotonic millisecond clock used by `xgl_step()`. A"
" successful return means local acceptance, not remote application completion."

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:12
msgid "数据所有权"
msgstr "Data Ownership"

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:14
msgid "调用期间借用 payload。可靠发送先将字节复制到有界的协议自有槽位，再保留用于重传；返回后调用者可以复用输入。PHY TX 必须同步消费或复制完整帧，不能保留协议指针。"
msgstr ""
"The payload is borrowed during the call. Reliable sends copy bytes into bounded protocol-owned slots "
"before retaining them for retransmission. The caller may reuse its input after return. PHY TX must "
"consume or copy the frame synchronously and must not retain a protocol pointer."

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:27
msgid ""
"示例假定应用变量有效且 handle 已初始化。Payload 长度必须非零，`priority` 为 0–7，只编码到 wire traffic class；SDK 不据此排序本地发送或抢占其他 peer。"
msgstr ""
"The example assumes valid application variables and an initialized handle. The payload must be nonempty "
"and `priority` must be in 0–7. Priority is encoded in the wire traffic class and does not affect local "
"scheduling or preemption of other peers."

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:29
msgid "调用者提供帧存储"
msgstr "Caller-Owned Frame Storage"

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:31
msgid ""
"`<xgl/xgl_inplace.h>` 提供同步非可靠单帧发送。用 `xgl_send_zerocopy_layout()` 查询精确空间，再把非空载荷放入调用者帧缓冲区，通过 "
"`xgl_send_zerocopy_scoped_at()` 提交。工作区布局、写入位置和实现示例见[零拷贝](in-place-send.md)。"
msgstr ""
"`<xgl/xgl_inplace.h>` provides synchronous unreliable single-frame transmission. Use "
"`xgl_send_zerocopy_layout()` to get the exact required space, place the nonempty payload in the caller's"
" frame buffer and submit it with `xgl_send_zerocopy_scoped_at()`. See [Zero-Copy Send](in-place-send.md)"
" for layout, write positions and an implementation example."

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:55
msgid "Network TX 包数及 payload 字节数只在下层提交成功后计入，普通、原地与转发路径保持一致。这些计数不证明远端交付。"
msgstr ""
"Network TX packets and payload bytes commit only after successful lower-layer submission, consistently "
"for copied, in-place and forwarded frames. These counters do not prove remote delivery."

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:57
msgid ""
"本机发送时，Network 使用 32 字节的临时缓冲组合 Transport 生成的扩展，编码阶段追加所需的 SECURITY。接收和转发仍按完整 Wire 帧校验，帧头的线上上限为 255 字节。"
msgstr ""
"For local sends, Network composes Transport-generated extensions using 32 bytes of temporary storage. "
"Encoding adds SECURITY when required. Receive and forwarding validate complete Wire frames, whose header"
" limit is 255 bytes."

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:59
msgid "可靠和非可靠发送"
msgstr "Reliable and Unreliable"

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:61
msgid "可靠发送同时受单 peer 窗口和全局 TX 容量约束。持续调用 `xgl_step()` 以接收 ACK、推进重传并报告最终失败。"
msgstr ""
"Reliable sends are constrained by the peer window and global TX capacity. Continue calling `xgl_step()` "
"to receive ACKs, advance retransmissions, and report terminal failures."

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:41
msgid ""
"普通发送的 `timeout_ms` 指定每个可靠包的初始 ACK 等待时间，应用事务有独立的完成期限。零值使用当前 profile 支持的 RTT 估计，尚无估计时使用配置的 ACK "
"等待时间，配置值也为零则回退到内建默认值；重传可调整等待时间。非可靠发送不创建 ACK 计时器。"
msgstr ""
"For ordinary reliable sends, `timeout_ms` sets the initial ACK wait per packet. The application sets a "
"separate transaction deadline. A zero uses the current RTT estimate when supported by the profile. "
"Without an estimate, it uses the configured ACK wait or the built-in default if the configuration is "
"also zero. Retransmission may adjust the wait. Unreliable sends have no ACK timer."

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:65
msgid ""
"`reliable=true` 要求单播目标。广播目标 `0xFFFF` 会在分配 peer 或重传状态前以 `XGL_ERR_INVALID_PARAM` "
"拒绝。认证策略允许时，普通非可靠广播仍可通过显式路由发送。"
msgstr ""
"`reliable=true` requires a unicast target. A broadcast target (`0xFFFF`) is rejected with "
"`XGL_ERR_INVALID_PARAM` before allocating peer or retransmission state. Plain unreliable broadcast "
"remains available through an explicit route when authentication policy permits it."

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:67
msgid "非可靠发送不提供 ACK/重试保证。PHY 返回成功只确认本地帧接纳。SDK 不提供公开的逐消息交付完成回调，需要区分远端处理结果时应设计应用层响应。"
msgstr ""
"Unreliable sends do not create an ACK/retry guarantee. A PHY success confirms local frame acceptance "
"only. The SDK has no public per-message delivery-completion callback; use an application response if "
"that distinction matters."

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:69
msgid "应用分块"
msgstr "Application Blocks"

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:71
msgid ""
"每次 `xgl_send_at()` 提交一个 DATA 帧。按[线格式](../reference/protocol/v1/wire-format.md)计算载荷上限，计入完整路径 MTU、实际 TLV "
"和认证标签。超出一帧返回 `XGL_ERR_BUFFER_TOO_SMALL`，发生在创建 peer、发送 HELLO 和提交 PHY 之前。"
msgstr ""
"Each DATA submission fits in one frame. The payload budget is the effective frame MTU minus the base "
"header, TLVs, authentication tag when present, and final CRC. Check the [wire "
"budget](../reference/protocol/v1/wire-format.md#size-budget) and both directions of the route for "
"reliable traffic. A payload above the single-frame budget returns `XGL_ERR_BUFFER_TOO_SMALL` before "
"creating a peer, sending HELLO or submitting DATA."

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:73
msgid ""
"传输文件或固件时，应用定义块编号与写入位置，并让每个块装入一帧。可靠传输处理单块的丢包与重试，业务回执可以确认整批数据是否写入或生效。[可运行示例](../tutorials/examples.md)包含文件分块和固件写入确认。"
msgstr ""
"For a larger transfer, choose a block size that fits the end-to-end path, including any application "
"metadata. Send blocks independently with `xgl_send_at()` and use application IDs or offsets to correlate"
" them. The [file transfer example](../tutorials/examples.md) sends fixed blocks. Firmware updates can "
"use application receipts to confirm durable writes."

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:75
msgid "接收接纳和回调"
msgstr "Receive Admission and Callbacks"

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:55
msgid ""
"应用通过 `config.rx_callback` 接收借用的载荷和 `xgl_rx_info_t`。消费或复制载荷后返回 `XGL_OK`；临时背压返回 `XGL_ERR_BUSY` 或 "
"`XGL_ERR_NO_MEMORY`。回调的 `user_data` 来自 `config.rx_user_data`。"
msgstr ""
"The application receives borrowed payload and `xgl_rx_info_t` through `config.rx_callback`. Return "
"`XGL_OK` after consuming or copying the payload, or `XGL_ERR_BUSY` or `XGL_ERR_NO_MEMORY` for temporary "
"backpressure. The callback receives `config.rx_user_data` as its `user_data`."

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:57
msgid ""
"接收回调为空时，`xgl_step()` 和 `xgl_step_bounded()` 对本地 DATA 返回 `XGL_ERR_UNSUPPORTED`，DATA "
"不进入缓存或确认。纯发送端可以保持空的接收回调并处理 ACK 和 CONTROL。有意丢弃数据的产品应实现显式接纳回调。"
msgstr ""
"With no receive callback, `xgl_step()` and `xgl_step_bounded()` return `XGL_ERR_UNSUPPORTED` for local "
"DATA, without buffering or acknowledging it. A sender-only endpoint can omit the callback and still "
"process ACK and CONTROL. To discard data intentionally, provide a callback that accepts it explicitly."

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:81
msgid "顺序包在应用接纳后才发送 ACK；乱序包只有进入协议自有的有界缓存才可发送 SACK。若已缓存的包暂时无法交付，继续运行 step 可重新尝试。"
msgstr ""
"An in-order reliable packet is ACKed after application acceptance. An out-of-order packet can be SACKed "
"once the protocol has retained its bytes. Keep stepping after application capacity returns to deliver "
"retained packets."

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:83
msgid ""
"ACK/SACK 提交错误会返回，但不撤销已接纳字节或接收编号；重试相同入站 DATA 不会重复已经成功的应用交付。后续维护遇到 BUSY 或 NO_MEMORY "
"时保留自有数据，作为正常背压处理；应用硬错误则终止所属 scope，释放字节并只报告一次。应用容量恢复后应通知协议 owner，因为仅等待应用交付不会创建就绪超时。"
msgstr ""
"An ACK/SACK submission error is returned without undoing accepted bytes or receive numbering. Retrying "
"the same incoming DATA never repeats successful application delivery. During later maintenance, BUSY or "
"NO_MEMORY retains owned data as normal backpressure; a hard application error fails the owning scope, "
"releases its bytes and is reported once. Notify the protocol owner when application capacity returns, "
"since pending application delivery alone does not create a ready timeout."

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:85
msgid "回调缓冲只在当前调用期间借用。回调不能重入、关闭或销毁实例，应把恢复动作排队，返回后执行。"
msgstr ""
"All callback buffers are borrowed only for that call. Callbacks must not reenter, close, or destroy the "
"instance; queue recovery work for after return."

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:65
msgid ""
"`xgl_rx_info_t` 包含发送方 ID、connection ID、epoch、应用 data type 和可靠性。`error_callback` 使用独立的 "
"`config.callback_user_data`，提供实例、错误码及诊断文本，诊断文本可以是空字符串。应用级逐消息完成需要业务消息 ID 和对应响应。"
msgstr ""
"`xgl_rx_info_t` contains the sender ID, connection ID, epoch, application data type and reliability. The"
" `error_callback` uses its own `config.callback_user_data` and receives the instance, error code and "
"diagnostic text, which can be an empty string. Per-message completion at the application layer requires "
"a business message ID and a matching response."

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:89
msgid "失败和 Scope 恢复"
msgstr "Failure and Scope Recovery"

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:91
msgid ""
"按具体操作将 `XGL_ERR_WINDOW_FULL`、`XGL_ERR_BUSY` 和 `XGL_ERR_NO_MEMORY` "
"作为容量或背压处理；重试被拒绝的提交前先处理接收工作。其他错误应检查参数、路由、PHY 或编译能力。"
msgstr ""
"Treat `XGL_ERR_WINDOW_FULL`, `XGL_ERR_BUSY`, and `XGL_ERR_NO_MEMORY` as capacity/backpressure conditions"
" where appropriate; process incoming work before retrying a rejected submission. Check other errors for "
"invalid input, route failure, PHY failure, or unsupported capability."

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:93
msgid ""
"`xgl_step()` 返回首个接收错误或维护硬错误，同时继续独立工作。维护重试在临时背压后仍持有数据时，应用无需再次提交该数据。错误回调描述 scope 失败和指定诊断，不能替代检查操作返回值。"
msgstr ""
"`xgl_step()` reports the first receive or hard maintenance error while continuing independent work. A "
"maintenance retry that retains data after temporary backpressure does not require the application to "
"submit that data again. Error callbacks describe scope failures and selected diagnostics; they are not a"
" replacement for checking operation return values."

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:73
msgid ""
"可靠 scope 由远端 ID、connection ID 和 epoch 标识。现存 scope 终止后，普通发送、零拷贝发送及布局查询都会拒绝该 scope 的有效 DATA 请求，返回 "
"`XGL_ERR_ACK_TIMEOUT`。其他 connection ID 或 epoch 不受该终止状态影响。拒绝不创建 peer、不调用认证 provider 或 PHY，也不增加发送尝试统计。"
msgstr ""
"A reliable scope is identified by remote node ID, connection ID and epoch. Once a scope terminates, "
"ordinary send, zero-copy send and layout queries reject valid DATA requests for that scope with "
"`XGL_ERR_ACK_TIMEOUT`. Other connection IDs or epochs are unaffected. The rejection creates no peer, "
"calls neither the provider nor the PHY, and does not increment send-attempt statistics."

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:97
msgid ""
"已使用可靠包编号的 scope 不会因空闲超时被静默回收。硬失败或 RESET 不能导致序列号复用。未认证 scope 使用 `xgl_close_peer()` 关闭，排空旧链路流量后以新 epoch "
"重连；显式关闭时，尚有待发数据会报告 `XGL_ERR_CANCELLED`。认证 peer 则必须关闭安全会话并安装新的可信参数。"
msgstr ""
"A scope that has used reliable packet numbers is not silently reclaimed by an idle timeout. Hard failure"
" or RESET must not cause sequence-number reuse. Close an unauthenticated scope with `xgl_close_peer()`, "
"drain stale link traffic, and reconnect with a new epoch. Pending TX reports `XGL_ERR_CANCELLED` on "
"explicit close. Authenticated peers must instead close the security session and install fresh trusted "
"parameters."

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:99
msgid "应用 Data Type"
msgstr "Application Data Type"

#: docs/zh/guides/send.md:101
msgid ""
"`data_type` 是应用分类字节，非零时增加 DATA_TYPE_EXT 并减少可用 payload。它与协议 DATA/ACK/控制包类型独立。选择 MTU 时要计入扩展、认证及 CRC 开销。"
msgstr ""
"`data_type` is an application classification byte. Nonzero values add DATA_TYPE_EXT and reduce available"
" payload space. It is independent of the protocol's DATA/ACK/control packet type. Include extension, "
"authentication, and CRC overhead when choosing MTU."
